        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E D1, Navajo Solid Brass Entry Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe simple style of this Fusion Navajo Entry Set makes it the perfect handleset for any home from colonial to more modern decors. The addition of the knob or lever that you choose, makes it adaptable to whatever aesthetic you desire. It is available in antique copper, antique bronze, and brushed nickel finishes. With standard 5-1/2 inch on center door boring, it will fit most pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Navajo Entry Set Fusion D1\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and castings.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li> Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Navajo Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>One year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Navajo Keyed Entry Plate, Fusion-E-D1",
                "description": "Navajo Entry Plate Fusion E D1 - The simple style of this Fusion Navajo Entry Set makes it the perfect handleset for any home from colonial to more modern decors. The addition of the knob or lever that you choose, makes it adaptable to whatever aesthetic you desire. It is available in antique copper, antique bronze, and brushed nickel finishes. With standard 5-1/2 inch on center door boring, it will fit most pre-drilled doors.",
